  "description": "Provides all high-level OASIS manager classes including AvatarManager, KarmaManager, HolonManager, DataManager, MapManager, SearchManager, ProviderManager, and more. These managers are the recommended integration point for .NET apps -- they abstract the underlying HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture and give you clean, consistent async APIs for avatars, karma, holons, keys/wallets, NFTs, search, and geo-data across 55+ providers. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one",
