  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Managers v2.0.4\n\nProvides all high-level OASIS manager classes including AvatarManager, KarmaManager, HolonManager, DataManager, MapManager, SearchManager, ProviderManager, and more. These managers are the recommended integration point for .NET apps -- they abstract the underlying HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture and give you clean, consistent async APIs for avatars, karma, holons, keys/wallets, NFTs, search, and geo-data across 55+ providers. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Managers",
